<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 2.x Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept id="motor_log_events" xml:lang="en-us">
   <title>Motor Log Events</title>
   <shortdesc>This section describes the events of the motor log.</shortdesc>
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <keyword>Motor</keyword>
        <keyword>Events</keyword>
        <keyword>motor</keyword>
        <keyword>events</keyword>
        <keyword>learning</keyword>
        <keyword>comment</keyword>
        <indexterm>Motor</indexterm>
        <indexterm>Events</indexterm>
        <indexterm>motor</indexterm>
      </keywords>
      <prodinfo>
        <prodname></prodname>
      </prodinfo>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
   <conbody><p>This section describes the events of the motor log.</p>
<p>Each Motor has an associated Motor Log. This log has historical entries that record the various events that the motor has experienced:</p>
<table frame="all" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
            <title>Motor Log Events</title>
            <tgroup cols="2">
               <colspec colname="c1"/>
               <colspec colname="c2"/>
               <tbody>
                  <row>
                     <entry>
                        <b>S</b>
                        <b>t</b>
                        <b>a</b>
                        <b>t</b>
                        <b>e</b>
                     </entry>
                     <entry>
                        <b>D</b>
                        <b>e</b>
                        <b>s</b>
                        <b>c</b>
                        <b>r</b>
                        <b>i</b>
                        <b>pt</b>
                        <b>i</b>
                        <b>on</b>
                     </entry>
                  </row>
                  <row>
                     <entry>
                        <codeblock>learning</codeblock>
                     </entry>
                     <entry>Motor is learning to generate model</entry>
                  </row>
                  <row>
                     <entry>
                        <codeblock>alarm</codeblock>
                     </entry>
                     <entry>One or more components have an FSI below ‘5ʼ</entry>
                  </row>
                  <row>
                     <entry>
                        <codeblock>comment</codeblock>
                     </entry>
                     <entry>Operator added a comment through the cloud web or mobile application</entry>
                  </row>
                  <row>
                     <entry>
                        <codeblock>repaired</codeblock>
                     </entry>
                     <entry>Operator took remedial action and marked the motor as repaired</entry>
                  </row>
                  <row>
                     <entry>
                        <codeblock>recovered</codeblock>
                     </entry>
                     <entry>Motor condition has improved; the FSI has increased to ‘5ʼ or above</entry>
                  </row>
               </tbody>
            </tgroup>
         </table></conbody>
</concept>
